00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.524
Oh, because this is a musical.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.442
What is?

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.110
All of this.

00:00:27.402 --> 00:00:28.570
The after life.

00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.030
Yay!

00:00:30.155 --> 00:00:31.156
