00:00:31.156 --> 00:00:33.075
Ah, come on. Really?

00:00:33.075 --> 00:00:34.868
♪♪

00:01:39.850 --> 00:01:41.101
Dude, I can't dance like this.

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.769
Are you gonna be able to
keep up with all this?

00:01:43.061 --> 00:01:44.980
I mean, if I start dancing I
gonna shut it down,

00:01:44.980 --> 00:01:46.440
man, everybody gonna look bad.

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:47.065
